cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Baseline Localizers and Paired Statistical Comparison (Section 4.3 reference implementation)"
abstract: >-
  Single-file C++17 reference implementation of Section 4.3 (baseline methods and
  the statistical comparison plan) of a dissertation on hybrid Bayesian tactical
  spatial identification of Wi-Fi signal sources: trilateration, WKNN and
  probabilistic fingerprinting baselines on a synthetic radiomap, compared with
  block-bootstrap confidence intervals, the Wilcoxon signed-rank test,
  Hodges-Lehmann estimator, McNemar test, Cliff's delta, Holm-Bonferroni control
  and Friedman/Nemenyi analysis.
type: software
